@startuml
[*] --> ShutDown : Restart

ShutDown --> Running : When the system restarts
Running --> ConfigMode : Changes or power-saving settings required
ConfigMode --> Running : After configuration is completed
Running --> Running : Data collection triggered by clock
Running --> ControlledMode : Through remote control command
Running --> ShutDown : If a shutdown command is given while running

ControlledMode --> Running : To return to normal operation

ShutDown --> [*] : Shutdown command

@enduml
